=== GATE 5 FOLLOW-UP: tau_ex PROFILE at the shipped mode (others FROZEN) ===
  observed NH->SH bomb lag 1.34 yr; the mode's tau_ex is 1.159 yr
   tau_ex  bomb lag     co2_grad    d13c_grad   total logL
    0.600      0.51       -424.4        -71.9      -2773.2
    0.800      0.88       -178.7         34.3      -1954.4
    1.159      0.97         -5.1        106.1      -1527.8
    1.400      1.01        -75.8         75.5      -1675.3
    2.000      1.11       -876.0       -243.3      -3099.1
    3.000      1.91      -4055.1      -1406.1      -8221.1

  THE TWO OBSERVABLES DISAGREE, AND THE GRADIENT WINS BY THREE ORDERS OF
  MAGNITUDE. The bomb lag rises monotonically with tau_ex and needs roughly
  2.3 yr to reach the observed 1.34; both gradient streams sit at a sharp
  INTERIOR optimum at the mode's 1.159 and fall away steeply on both sides.
  So gate 5's lag miss is a FORCED residual, not an overlooked one -- the
  model cannot satisfy both interhemispheric constraints with one tau_ex,
  which makes this a STRUCTURAL finding about the two-box exchange rather
  than a parameter that has not been tried.

